    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s New?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New Worker Types: <br>Runner \u2013 Carries food boxes, restocks supplies, and refills cooking stations. <br>Chef Upgrade \u2013 Now refills stations when food boxes are available in his station. <br>Cleaner \u2013 Keeps the restaurant spotless, no more garbage piles! <br>Cashier \u2013 Takes orders, collects food, and serves customers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Restaurant Expansion: <br>Grow your restaurant, expand the cooking area, and even open a second floor for more customers! Add extra cash registers to handle the rush and keep customers happy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Decorate &amp; Personalize: <br>Paint walls and floors to match your style. Add flowers, paintings, and custom signboards to make your restaurant stand out. Rename your restaurant and truly make it your own! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357250/extras/6be61d8959a9b1b470cea239f1e0cf3e.poster.avif?t=1741788833\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357250/extras/6be61d8959a9b1b470cea239f1e0cf3e.webm?t=1741788833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357250/extras/6be61d8959a9b1b470cea239f1e0cf3e.mp4?t=1741788833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take customer orders and serve their meals quickly to keep them happy and earn positive reviews.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357250/extras/1febf30071fb846a944fd4a6f8ac44bb.poster.avif?t=1741788833\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357250/extras/1febf30071fb846a944fd4a6f8ac44bb.webm?t=1741788833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357250/extras/1febf30071fb846a944fd4a6f8ac44bb.mp4?t=1741788833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and furnish your restaurant with tables, chairs, and decorations to attract more diners. Keep it spotless to ensure excellent reviews and customer satisfaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire skilled cooks and staff to improve efficiency and train them to run operations smoothly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your equipment, experiment with new recipes, and expand your restaurant\u2019s size and reach to dominate the fast-food industry in the city.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s New?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New Worker Types: <br>Runner \u2013 Carries food boxes, restocks supplies, and refills cooking stations. <br>Chef Upgrade \u2013 Now refills stations when food boxes are available in his station. <br>Cleaner \u2013 Keeps the restaurant spotless, no more garbage piles! <br>Cashier \u2013 Takes orders, collects food, and serves customers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Restaurant Expansion: <br>Grow your restaurant, expand the cooking area, and even open a second floor for more customers! Add extra cash registers to handle the rush and keep customers happy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Decorate &amp; Personalize: <br>Paint walls and floors to match your style. Add flowers, paintings, and custom signboards to make your restaurant stand out. Rename your restaurant and truly make it your own! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357250/extras/6be61d8959a9b1b470cea239f1e0cf3e.poster.avif?t=1741788833\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357250/extras/6be61d8959a9b1b470cea239f1e0cf3e.webm?t=1741788833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357250/extras/6be61d8959a9b1b470cea239f1e0cf3e.mp4?t=1741788833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take customer orders and serve their meals quickly to keep them happy and earn positive reviews.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357250/extras/1febf30071fb846a944fd4a6f8ac44bb.poster.avif?t=1741788833\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357250/extras/1febf30071fb846a944fd4a6f8ac44bb.webm?t=1741788833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357250/extras/1febf30071fb846a944fd4a6f8ac44bb.mp4?t=1741788833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and furnish your restaurant with tables, chairs, and decorations to attract more diners. Keep it spotless to ensure excellent reviews and customer satisfaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire skilled cooks and staff to improve efficiency and train them to run operations smoothly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your equipment, experiment with new recipes, and expand your restaurant\u2019s size and reach to dominate the fast-food industry in the city.</p></li></ul>",
